@page "/sms/company"
@inject SmsUrls Links

<PageTitle>Company · Sequoia Marine Solutions</PageTitle>
<HeadContent><meta name="description" content="How Sequoia Marine Solutions is organized: a C-suite, seven subsystems and 51 students from every major." /></HeadContent>

<section class="sms-page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
        <p class="sms-kicker">Company</p>
        <h1 class="sms-page-hero__title">Run like a real firm.</h1>
        <p class="sms-page-hero__lede">51 students, a C-suite, seven subsystem leads and a purchase-request process that goes through design, operations and finance before anything gets ordered.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sms-section" aria-labelledby="org-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <p class="sms-kicker sms-kicker--dark">2026 org chart</p>
        <h2 class="sms-h2" id="org-title">Who answered to whom.</h2>
        <OrgChart Root="ClubFacts.SmsOrg2026" />

        <div class="org__leads">
            <p class="sms-kicker sms-kicker--dark">Subsystem leads · reporting to the CTO and CDO</p>
            <ul class="people">
                @foreach (var p in ClubFacts.SmsLeads2026) { <li class="reveal"><PersonCard Person="p" /></li> }
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sms-section sms-section--cream">
    <div class="wrap split">
        <div class="split__head">
            <p class="sms-kicker sms-kicker--dark">Subsystems</p>
            <h2 class="sms-h2">Seven crews, one robot.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="subsystems reveal">
            <li>ROV Manipulators</li><li>ROV Chassis & Propulsion</li><li>ROV Controls & Electronics</li>
            <li>Float Chassis & Buoyancy</li><li>Float Controls & Electronics</li><li>GUI & Communications</li>
            <li>Deck Management</li><li>Marketing</li><li>Logistics</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="sms-section">
    <div class="wrap split">
        <div class="split__head">
            <p class="sms-kicker sms-kicker--dark">What we learned</p>
            <h2 class="sms-h2">Communication, creativity, autonomy.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose reveal">
            <p>From our 2026 company evaluation: with over fifty people involved, structure came first. Then the Chief Design Officer ran idea-generation workshops, which produced the harpoon manipulators. As the year went on, leads handed more ownership to individual members, and the chassis came together from many people's work: thruster shrouds, camera mounts, manipulators.</p>
            <p><a class="btn btn--sms-dark" href="@Links.Avi("/join")">Join through AVI</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
